# The Isobar Club (CIPlay the_isobar_club): the plan The Rainmakers' eighth island, quest "Members Only"
# The upper shelf (6.2 m) round 0 -2 r 24: the pavilion x -7.5..7.5 z -10..-1, its colonnade to z -14.5; the lower
# terrace (1.5 m) z -38..-26 with the tidal pools east, the wine cellar x -20..-14 z -35..-27.5; the funicular at 0 -28.3.
island The Isobar Club
offset 0 35
expect step 0
expect title Members Only
wait 3
zone terrace
expect step 1
read Members' book
expect step 2
at 0 -28.3 h=1.5
use clublift stay
wait 7
expect shown clubliftup
zone club
expect step 3
read Board minutes
expect step 4
open Secretary's safe
expect message locked from the keypad
code safekeypad 1111 wrong
code safekeypad 6206
open Secretary's safe
expect story cabinetkey 1
expect step 5
open Secretary's cabinet
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_TitaniumTools 1
expect item Blueprint_BackpackAdvanced 1
expect item Blueprint_ZiplineToolElectric 1
expect story cellarkey 1
expect step 9
# RAIN 10-26: the hub, Lord Arvid Hale, the climb, Smugglers' Cave, the secrets
expect hidden ic_rewchest
use ic_machine
expect hidden ic_rewchest
read Steward's notice
expect step 10
use Lord Arvid Hale
wait 1
expect step 11
expect hidden ic_lampchest
use Folly lamp 1
use Folly lamp 2
wait 1
expect shown ic_lampchest
open Lord Hale's strongbox
zone ic_trail
expect step 12
zone ic_summit
expect step 13
open Club's weather mast deck box
wait 3
expect story ic_top 1
expect step 14
zone ic_cave
expect step 15
open Smugglers' Cave chest
wait 3
expect story ic_cave 1
expect step 16
use ic_machine
expect shown ic_rewchest
expect story ic_fixed 1
open Club signal reward
wait 3
read Signal book
expect step 17
# the secrets: the plane, the jumps, the maze, the set
zone ic_plane
open Member's plane crate
read Member's flight card
zone ic_jumps
open Folly perch
open Folly top
zone ic_maze
open Maze prize
expect hidden ic_setchest
use ic_piece1
use ic_piece2
use ic_piece3
use ic_piece4
use ic_piece5
wait 2
expect shown ic_setchest
open Trophy case
zone cellar
open Dagny's case
expect message under the engineer's hand
use dagnycage
expect survivor rainmakers_dagny
open Dagny's case
expect done
